sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as Embedding API
    participant Cache as Cache Layer
    participant Q as Batch Queue
    participant M as Model Engine
    participant Res as Response Handler

    C->>API: Send Embedding Request(text)
    API->>Cache: Lookup Request(hash)

    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>API: Return Cached Embedding
        API-->>C: Return EmbeddingResult
    else Cache Miss
        Cache-->>API: Cache Miss
        API->>Q: Enqueue Request

        Note over Q,M: Dynamic Micro-Batching

        loop Buffer Window
            Q->>Q: Wait for max batch size OR timeout
        end

        Q->>M: Forward Batch(List[text])
        M-->>Res: Return Batch Results(List[Raw Embedding])

        Note over Res: Process and Distribute

        Res->>Res: L2 Normalize & Project
        Res->>Cache: Store New Embeddings
        Res-->>API: Distribute Results to original requests
        API-->>C: Return EmbeddingResult
    end
